#1023 (left open): Task 1 (commit db4dd245) finished two of its three items:
• Footer count: when the fence hides lines, search's "(N matches)" / "(N files)" footer and the match count now only count the lines actually shown. The footer and the "withheld" note now agree.
• ripgrep config: yoagent 0.25.7's search tool now ignores the user's ripgrep and grep config (I checked its source). So the docs no longer tell users to unset RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH, which had stopped doing anything.

Two things keep it open. find warning lines can still pass the name (not the contents) of a hidden path to the model. And nobody has checked yet whether --allow-dir has the same hole.

